C4;padding-bottom:2px;\">Llamar a la clínica</a><br/><span style=\"color:#A49584;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;\">+34 916 401 575</span>\n          </p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:30px 56px 24px 56px;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n          <p style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:19px;font-style:italic;color:#8B6F5A;line-height:1.5;margin:0;\">&ldquo;Cuidamos sonrisas<br/>como se cuidan las cosas bellas:<br/>con tiempo y con calma.&rdquo;</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\" class=\"footer-pad\" style=\"background-color:#3D2F26;padding:36px 44px;\">\n          <p style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#EFECE8;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">Clínica Zen</p>\n          <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:12px 0;\">\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"width:28px;height:1px;background-color:#8B6F5A;font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n              <td style=\"padding:0 10px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:10px;color:#A49584;\">&diams;</td>\n              <td style=\"width:28px;height:1px;background-color:#8B6F5A;font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n          <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#A49584;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0 0 6px 0;\">Calle Castillo de Atienza, 1 bis &middot; Las Rozas de Madrid</p>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://clinicazen.es\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#EFECE8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid #8B6F5A;padding-bottom:2px;\">www.clinicazen.es</a></p>\n          <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#8B6F5A;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:18px 0 0 0;line-height:1.7;\">Este correo se generó automáticamen